# Preset `go` (PROXY_PRESETS=go): the Go module proxy and checksum database, which
# `go mod download`, `go get` and toolchain switching use with Go's defaults
# (GOPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org,direct, GOSUMDB=sum.golang.org).
#
# Opt-in, not in the base list, because the Go module proxy fetches any public
# module path from its origin on request: a module path the agent chooses becomes a
# request to a host the agent chooses, made by Google's proxy instead of this one.
# Turn it on when the site's repos need Go (WITH_GO=1); doctor.sh warns when the two
# disagree.
^proxy\.golang\.org$
^sum\.golang\.org$
